  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0 - Initial stable release! Complete event sourcing and CQRS implementation with Aggregate pattern for managing root entities, Saga orchestration for long-running transactions, event-driven communication, view model projection system, multi-framework support (.NET 4.6.2, .NET Standard 2.0/2.1, .NET 9.0, .NET 10.0), OpenTelemetry integration for observability, and dependency injection support. Production-ready with comprehensive test coverage.",
